What was derived from upstream
------------------------------

- `lib/client.js` — the window transport (webview methods, dock tabs, the
  `sidebarRight` service calls) is upstream's, with the bridge secret and the DOM
  hook report added by spec 014.
- `lib/index.js` — the in-page DOM snippets (`SNAPSHOT_JS`, `SCROLL_INFO_JS`,
  `RENDER_SHOT_JS`, the key table) and the tool descriptions are upstream's.
  The CDP transport and the three cookie tools were removed (spec 014 C3/C5);
  the advance-approval gate, the bridge secret, the untrusted-content wrapping and
  the savePath confinement are new.

Not derived from upstream: `lib/remote-scope.js`, the tests, this NOTICE, the
`cordis.patch.yml` row.

